  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "Given : 24 ÷ 8 + 2 − 7 × 32 = 170\n\nLets check each option :\n\n1) 24 and 32; + and −\n\nAfter interchanging, we get:\n\n⇒ __**32 ÷ 8**__ - 2 + 7 × 24 = 170\n\n⇒ 4 - 2 + __**7 × 24**__ = 170\n\n⇒ __**4**__ - 2 __**+ 168**__ = 170\n\n⇒ __**172 - 2**__ = 170\n\n⇒ __**170 = 170**__ \n\n2) 2 and 32; − and ÷\n\nAfter interchanging, we get:\n\n⇒ 24 - 8 + __**32 ÷ 7**__ × 2 = 170\n\n⇒ 24 - 8 + __**4.57 × 2**__ = 170\n\n⇒ __**24**__ - 8 __**+ 9.14**__ = 170\n\n⇒ __**33.14 - 8**__ = 170\n\n⇒ __**25.14 ≠ 170**__\n\n3) 7 and 24; + and −\n\nAfter interchanging, we get:\n\n⇒ __**7 ÷ 8**__ - 2 + 24 × 32 = 170\n\n⇒ 0.875 - 2 + __**24 × 32**__ = 170\n\n⇒ __**0.875**__ - 2 **__+ 768__** = 170\n\n⇒ __**768.875 - 2**__ = 170\n\n⇒ __**766.875 ≠ 170**__\n\n4) 8 and 32; ÷ and × \n\nAfter interchanging, we get:\n\n⇒ 24 × 32 + 2 − __**7 ÷ 8**__ = 170\n\n⇒ __**24 × 32**__ + 2 − 0.875 = 170\n\n⇒ __**768 + 2**__ − 0.875 = 170\n\n⇒ __**770 − 0.875**__ = 170\n\n⇒ __**769.125 ≠ 170**__\n\nHence, **'option 1'** is the correct answer.",
